  "body": "With a clear motivation to sell, the vendor is ready to meet the market. Act quickly, bring your offer and make your move.\r\n\r\nFour bedrooms, two bathrooms, double garaging and a family-friendly layout, all wrapped up in an easy-care 356m² freehold site. Welcome to 10 Clea View.\r\nWhether you're taking your first step onto the property ladder, looking for a home that can accommodate a growing family, or simply wanting a low-maintenance base in popular Gulf Harbour, this is a property that deserves your attention.\r\nBeautifully presented and thoughtfully laid out across two levels, the home offers genuine separation between living and sleeping spaces. The ground floor is anchored by a generous master bedroom complete with its own ensuite, while upstairs you'll find three further bedrooms and the family bathroom, providing plenty of flexibility for children, guests, working from home or simply spreading out.\r\nThe heart of the home is bright, warm and welcoming, with comfortable living spaces designed for everyday family life. Outside, the fully fenced section provides a safe and manageable space for children, pets and summer entertaining without the ongoing commitment of a large section.\r\nA double internal-access garage provides excellent storage, complemented by additional off-street parking and a generous driveway.\r\nThis is a home that combines practical design with the convenience of a modern-era build. And then there's the location. Gulf Harbour offers a relaxed coastal lifestyle with schools, local amenities, cafés, recreational facilities and the waterfront all close at hand.\r\nPerhaps most importantly, this is a home that makes sense. Four bedrooms, two bathrooms, excellent parking and an easy-care section at a price point that remains accessible in today's market.\r\nCome and see why 10 Clea View could be the right fit for you.",
